CC-CEDICT dictionary
-------------------
src/data/dictionary.db contains data from CC-CEDICT, maintained by the
CC-CEDICT contributors and distributed by MDBG:
https://www.mdbg.net/chinese/dictionary?page=cc-cedict

The SQLite builder uses the cedict-json conversion by Mani (Infinyte7):
https://github.com/krmanik/cedict-json

Both the dictionary data and that JSON conversion are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

ScreenPinyin converts numbered pinyin to tone marks, combines definitions,
and stores the entries in a SQLite FTS5 index. These adapted dictionary
data remain under CC BY-SA 4.0; the application's MIT license does not
replace that license. No endorsement by the contributors is implied.

